<title>UK: UK's Ionica sees shares pricing at 370-390p/each.</title>
<headline>UK's Ionica sees shares pricing at 370-390p/each.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>British telephone operator Ionica Plc said on Wednesday it expected its shares to price at 370-390p in its global offering, which should net about 125 million stg of new capital for the firm.</p>
</text>
